<title>USA: Brooke Group Ltd Q4 oper loss rises.</title>
<headline>Brooke Group Ltd Q4 oper loss rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	     $1.23     loss	 $0.97</p>
<p> Oper net loss	    22,732     loss	17,671</p>
<p> Revs			122,292		  119,741</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   18,497		   18,456</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	     $3.41     loss	 $1.56</p>
<p> Oper net loss	    64,918     loss	45,344</p>
<p> Revs			452,656		  461,459</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   18,497		   18,301</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Oper net excludes income from discontinued operations of $0.13/shr vs $0.29 in Q4, and $0.13/shr vs $1.16 for year.</p>
<p>Q4 and year 1995 oper net excludes $0.54/shr charge for early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>Net shr is loss $1.10 vs loss $1.22 for Q4, and loss $3.28 vs loss $0.94 for year.</p>
